      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i tripped on the sidewalk earlier and kinda hit my head pretty hard. im not bleeding or anything but im feeling a bit dizzy and the screen on my phone is actually making my eyes hurt kind of sensitive to the light. is there anything natural i can take or do to fix the dizziness so i can finish my shift? i dont really have time to go to the doctor right now",
