      "content": "thanks for the suggestions. the ginger tea sounds okay but i really need something that works faster so i can focus. do you think i could just take some extra ibuprofen or something to help with the inflammation? i have a whole bottle here so i can just take a few more if that helps the dizziness go away faster.",
